+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are `apiKeys` in the data
+(`{ key, name, role }`). Without a key or with an unknown key the answer is
+401 `unauthorized`; a known key without permission is 403 `forbidden`.
+
+- `viewer`: GET only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every authenticated request other than GET (also those refused or failed)
+writes `{ id, at, key, method, path, status }` to `audit`. `GET /audit` lists
+the entries newest first (managers only). Routes are listed in `README.md`;
+`GET /audit` is the audit list.
